[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0010","text":"辛苦啦——！\n……咦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0020","text":"巡，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0030","text":"是灯织啊！\n你在做什么呀？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0040","text":"法式吐司\n快做好了，要不要吃一点？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0050","text":"真的吗！？\n好想吃好想吃！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0060","text":"呵呵，嗯\n那稍等一下哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0070","text":"好——！\n谢谢──不对，等等等等！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0080","text":"有什么我能帮忙的吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0090","text":"啊，这样啊──不用啦，谢谢\n你能来吃本身就是帮忙了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0100","text":"哎呀，真是的！\n什么嘛——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
